00:59:58.060 --> 01:00:18.810
<v Ira Glass>Our website, thisamericanlife.org. This American Life is delivered to public radio stations by PRX, the Public Radio Exchange. Thanks, as always, to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia. He told me that growing up, his family had not one, not two, but three wells in the backyard. I was like, really?
<v Ira Glass>我们的网站，thisamericanlife.org。《美国生活》由公共广播交换平台PRX分发给公共广播电台。像往常一样，感谢我们节目的联合创始人托里·马拉蒂亚先生。他告诉我，他成长过程中，他们家后院不只有一口井，不是两口，而是三口。我说，真的吗？

01:00:18.810 --> 01:00:20.810
<v Victim Family Member>(SUBJECT) VICTIM FAMILY MEMBER: Well, well, well, yeah.
<v Victim Family Member>嗯，嗯，嗯，是的。

01:00:20.810 --> 01:00:25.810
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带回更多《美国生活》的故事。
